    "preamble": "Ejajuddeen vs State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Food ... on 31 May, 2024 Author: Sangeeta Chandra Bench: Sangeeta Chandra High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:41745-Db Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 4987 of 2024 Petitioner :- Ejajuddeen Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Food Safety And Drug Administration Lko. Counsel for Petitioner :- Shikhar Chaube,Kapil Gupta Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Anil Kumar Tripathi Hon'ble Mrs. Sangeeta Chandra,J. Hon'ble Brij Raj Singh,J. Heard learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Standing Counsel for the State-respondents. This petition has been filed with the following main prayer:- \"(I). Issue a writ, order or direction in nature of mandamus commanding & directing the opposite party no. 4 to consider and decide the representation dated 11.03.2024, as contained in Annexure No. 1 to this writ petition, within a short and reasonable Ejajuddeen vs State Of U.P. Thru. Secy. Deptt. Food ... on 31 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/50443908/ 1 time as prescribed by this Hon'ble Court, in the interest of justice.",
    "facts": "It is the case of the petitioner that petitioner has applied for license to run a meat shop for which NOC is required to be given by Superintendent of Police, Gonda/Station House Officer concerned.",
